Package: admiralagent
Type: Package
Title: Spec-Driven ADaM Code Generation with LLM-Translated Layers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("admiralagent", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Translates P21-style ADaM specifications into executable
    admiral code with validation comments. An LLM (optional, via ellmer) maps
    each spec variable's free-text derivation onto a closed vocabulary of
    derivation layers (structured JSON IR); a deterministic compiler renders
    the IR into admiral/metatools code with 'CHECK' validation comments and
    writes provenance sidecars. Ships with a zero-dependency rule-based
    classifier as baseline and fallback.
